From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wenhua.liu <wenhua.liu@haitaichina.com>
Date: Fri, 9 May 2026 13:15:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Apply -fPIC global cflag on target_os=harmony

build/config/compiler/BUILD.gn:682 sets `-fPIC` (asmflags / cflags /
ldflags / rustflags `-Crelocation-model=pic`) for the entire chromium
transitive set on Linux/ChromeOS/Android/Fuchsia. HarmonyOS shares the
Linux kernel + uapi (target triple aarch64-linux-ohos) and lynxtron_app
is built as a shared_library under target_os=harmony so the OHOS HAP
loader can dlopen liblynxtron.so. Without -fPIC the link fails with
R_AARCH64_ADD_ABS_LO12_NC / R_AARCH64_ADR_PREL_PG_HI21 reloc errors
across node inspector / cppgc / partition_alloc / libcxx-ohos
(absolute relocs only valid in PIE executables, not shared libraries).

Mirrors the same `is_linux || is_chromeos -> || is_harmony` extension
already applied to v8/BUILD.gn (wire-platform-linux-harmony.patch) and
base/BUILD.gn (wire-process-linux-harmony.patch).
---
 config/compiler/BUILD.gn | 10 ++++++++--
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/config/compiler/BUILD.gn b/config/compiler/BUILD.gn
index 2c549f1..d332d64 100644
--- a/config/compiler/BUILD.gn
+++ b/config/compiler/BUILD.gn
@@ -677,9 +677,15 @@ config("compiler") {
     rustflags += [ "-Csplit-debuginfo=unpacked" ]
   }

-  # Linux/Android/Fuchsia common flags setup.
+  # Linux/Android/Fuchsia/HarmonyOS common flags setup.
   # ---------------------------------
-  if (is_linux || is_chromeos || is_android || is_fuchsia) {
+  # HarmonyOS shares the Linux kernel + uapi (target triple
+  # aarch64-linux-ohos), and lynxtron_app is built as a shared_library
+  # under target_os=harmony so the OHOS HAP loader can dlopen
+  # liblynxtron.so. -fPIC must therefore be on for the entire chromium
+  # transitive set (otherwise ld.lld rejects R_AARCH64_ADD_ABS_LO12_NC /
+  # R_AARCH64_ADR_PREL_PG_HI21 against external symbols).
+  if (is_linux || is_chromeos || is_android || is_fuchsia || is_harmony) {
     asmflags += [ "-fPIC" ]
     cflags += [ "-fPIC" ]
     ldflags += [ "-fPIC" ]
--
2.34.1
